From: Mahdi Arts <mahdi-arts@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: 2026-08-21
Subject: [PATCH] ci: rename binary + harden release channels (SHA-pinned, fail-closed)

Apply to the live workflow files with:

    git am docs/patches/workflows-rename-and-hardening.patch

or, to apply without committing:

    git apply docs/patches/workflows-rename-and-hardening.patch

This patch carries changes that a GitHub App without the `workflows`
permission cannot push directly (see README). It:

1. Renames the smoke-test binary to `windows-11-style-clipboard-history-manager-bin`.
2. Makes the Cloudsmith / AUR distribution channels truly **fail-closed**
   (`set -euo pipefail`, no `continue-on-error`).
3. Pins `actions/stale` to a full commit SHA.

این پچ تغییرات فایل‌های workflow را که GitHub App بدون مجوز `workflows`
نمی‌تواند مستقیم push کند، منتقل می‌کند (نگاه کنید به README).

